hundreds of...

31:31.500 --> 31:38.500
of skimmer tapes and the skimmer
tape is basically when you're on
the air live and you crack

31:38.500 --> 31:41.500
the microphone then it starts
recording and these are all
cassette supports, that was

31:41.500 --> 31:42.500
the technology of the day.

31:42.500 --> 31:47.500
Really basically just a micro
switch, you open up the fader on
your mixing board or

31:47.500 --> 31:52.500
you open up that channel and it
clicks the pause switch and it
starts to record the

31:52.500 --> 31:57.500
air signal so that after the
show you can go back and listen
to yourself and listen

31:57.500 --> 32:02.500
to if you sucked or not, which
of course we all think we sucked
and that's a skimmer

32:02.500 --> 32:05.500
